<title>AUSTRIA: Creditanstalt grants 1 bln ATS credit to China bank.</title>
<headline>Creditanstalt grants 1 bln ATS credit to China bank.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's Creditanstalt-Bankverein said on Thursday it had granted a one billion schillings ($82.2 million) credit line to China Construction Bank to finance the purchase of 20 heavy locomotives over the next 15 years.</p>
<p>The agreement was the biggest single credit line granted to China by an Austrian bank, Creditanstalt said in a statement without providing further details.</p>
<p>It added most of the locomotive components would be produced by SGP Verkehrstechnik, an Austrian unit of Germany's Siemens, and delivered to China for assembly. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274 ($ = 12.16 Austrian Schillings)</p>
</text>
